  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1402.13 Disadvantaged affordability criteria",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1402.13 “Disadvantaged affordability criteria” means the criteria by which it is determined whether an eligible entity is eligible for loan forgiveness, as established in Env-Dw 1405.02.\n\nSource. #13164, eff 1-26-21; ss by #13372, eff 4-21-22",
